cloud_backup_generated_key_file_body:
Pulse sync key

{key}

Keep this key safe. It restores your list of self-hosted servers and your device identity on any device. Pulse does not know this key and cannot reset it.

instance_setup_ai_prompt:
Install Pulse (self-host) on my server. First read the full installation and troubleshooting reference at {guideUrl} — it describes what the installer does, which ports and DNS records are required, and how to fix common issues. Then run this command on the server and assist me if anything fails:

{command}

Note: the token in the command is valid for 20 minutes and single-use. Never print the contents of pulse.env or any secrets.
